idle-cli (3.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Foreign-language plugin support: stable C ABI (IdleSaverOps ops table,
    idle_saver.h header); loader prefers idle_saver_ops over the legacy
    Rust entry points — savers in C/Zig/openOODA can now plug in.
  * Fixed flaky env-var race in the test suite (shared ENV_LOCK).

 -- IdleScreen <jerydleuck@gmail.com>  Fri, 11 Sep 2026 18:00:00 +0000

